    "title": "Barcelona vs Sevilla Lineups, Predictions, Live Streaming, How & Where to Watch, TV Channels",
    "text": "FC Barcelona will play at the Spotify Camp Nou in La Liga as they host Sevilla for their 28th league match of the season. Barcelona remains top of the league table, with Real Madrid and Atletico Madrid right below them.Barcelona is 1st with 67 points after 27 league matches played, and their record is 22 wins, one draw, and four losses.AdvertisementSevilla is 15th in the league with 31 points and has a record of eight wins, seven draws, and 12 losses.Last weekend, Barcelona defeated Athletic Bilbao 1-0 away from home with a goal from Lamine Yamal. Sevilla drew 1-1 with Rayo Vallecano at the Estadio Ramon Sanchez Pizjuan.Sevilla hosted FC Barcelona at the Estadio Ramon Sanchez Pizjuan earlier this season on October 5, 2025. Sevilla defeated Barcelona 4-1 with goals from Alexis Sanchez, Isaac Romero, Jose Angel Carmona, and Akor Adams.AdvertisementRobert Lewandowski centre-forward of Barcelona and Poland after failed a kick off penalty during the LaLiga EA Sports match between Sevilla FC and FC Barcelona at Estadio Ramon Sanchez Pizjuan on October 5, 2025 in Seville, Spain. (Photo by Jose Breton/Pics Action/NurPhoto via Getty Images)Photo by Jose Breton/Pics Action/NurPhoto via Getty Images (Photo by Jose Breton&sol;Pics Action&sol;NurPhoto via Getty Images)Official Lineups for FC Barcelona and SevillaFC BarcelonaGoalkeeper: Joan GarciaDefenders: Joao Cancelo, Gerard Martin, Pau Cubarsi, Xavi EspartMidfielders: Pedri, Marc Bernal, Dani OlmoForwards: Raphinha, Robert Lewandowski, Roony BardghjiSevillaGoalkeeper: Odysseas VlachodimosDefenders: Gabriel Suazo, Nemanja Gudelj, Tanguy Nianzou, Jose Angel CarmonaMidfielders: Oso, Djibril Sow, Lucien Agoume, Juanlu SanchezForwards: Alexis Sanchez, Akor AdamsFC Barcelona vs Sevilla will kick off at 11:15 a.m. ET/ 8:15 a.m. PT in the United States. The match will kick off at 4:15 p.m. local time at the Spotify Camp Nou in Barcelona, Spain.The match will be available to watch in the United States and in other countries through select TV channels and streaming services.ESPN Select (USA)ESPN Unlimited (USA)ESPN Deportes (USA)Movistar (Spain)Prediction: FC Barcelona 3-1 SevillaThis story was originally published by Athlon Sports on Mar 15, 2026, where it first appeared in the Soccer section. Add Athlon Sports as a Preferred Source by clicking here.",
